# Hallowgate: a short platform where the starting signal is close enough to the
# one ahead that a full overlap will not fit, so the signal in rear is given a
# warning arrangement instead.

scheme hallowgate {
    area "Hallowgate"
    prefix H
}

node W boundary
node E boundary
node J1 plain
node J2 plain

edge H1 from W to J1 length 800 speed 45 direction down
edge H2 from J1 to J2 length 400 speed 30 direction down
edge H3 from J2 to E length 800 speed 45 direction down

section HA over H1
section HB over H2
section HC over H3

signal H1S on H1 at 800 facing forward direction down aspects 3 warning yes
signal H3S on H2 at 400 facing forward direction down aspects 3
